      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……我感到很荣幸。我向你发誓──\n我一定会正面回应这份期待，继续前进。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcd7a3e5e4e87ba1d50cebdf87398629465af7932b6bdfbdec1d1195c49c260b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
