      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这下谜团终于解开了。\n目白光明能够同时活跃于中长距离比赛，\n是一位拥有多元才华的赛马娘。此外──",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94afc87001f9027cb2891f6c725cf667adf275120e263d3d2846fedd58efcc5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1074/storytimeline_501074310.json",
      "json_path": [
