    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:22fe55ccc8e03b8c3f6f5e52",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成长过程中，她一直都在不着痕迹地接受着\n英才教育，同时一直将目白家的知名选手们的跑法\n深深烙印进眼帘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "33e7c01c99888f697f92d1ca74f7e73f6ff37e5f9ab0b7365a319c19050634fd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
